      typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
    - title: Description
      value: "Thirteen restless ghosts haunt the library, bound by a curse and hiding
        among the ancient shelves. To open the Ancient Door, one must track and defeat
        each spirit. \r\n\r\nBut beware: these spirits linger silently in the shadows,
        guarding the Ancient Door they are bound to protect. They pose no threat,
        but their watchful presence is a chilling reminder of what lies beyond. Only
        the determined should dare.\r\n"
